[{"id":"smq-year1-1.68-q1","number":1,"question":"<p>Two forces <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf P\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf Q\" data-display=\"false\"></span> act on a particle. The vectors <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf i\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf j\" data-display=\"false\"></span> are unit vectors due east and north respectively. Find the magnitude and direction (anticlockwise from the positive <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x\" data-display=\"false\"></span>-axis) of the resultant force in each case, giving your answers to 3 significant figures:</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf P=(2\\mathbf i-\\mathbf j)\\text{ N}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf Q=(-\\mathbf i+4\\mathbf j)\\text{ N}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf P=\\binom32\\text{ N}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf Q=\\binom5{-4}\\text{ N}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf P=(3\\mathbf i+\\mathbf j)\\text{ N}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf Q=(-5\\mathbf i+8\\mathbf j)\\text{ N}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf P=\\binom{-5}{-9}\\text{ N}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf Q=4\\binom12\\text{ N}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf P=(-0.5\\mathbf i+2\\mathbf j)\\text{ N}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf Q=3(\\mathbf i-6\\mathbf j)\\text{ N}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"2\\mathbf i-\\mathbf j-\\mathbf i+4\\mathbf j=\\mathbf i+3\\mathbf j\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/smq-1.68/solutions/assets/diagrams/s1a.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>","<p>Resultant force: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\sqrt{1^2+3^2}=\\sqrt{10}=3.16\" data-display=\"false\"></span> N (3 SF)</p>","<p>Angle with <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"Ox\" data-display=\"false\"></span>: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\theta=\\tan^{-1}\\left(\\frac31\\right)=71.6^\\circ\" data-display=\"false\"></span> (3 SF)</p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\binom32+\\binom5{-4}=\\binom8{-2}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/smq-1.68/solutions/assets/diagrams/s1b.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>","<p>Resultant force: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\sqrt{8^2+2^2}=2\\sqrt{17}=8.25\" data-display=\"false\"></span> N (3 SF)</p>","<p>Angle with <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"Ox\" data-display=\"false\"></span>: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\theta=-\\tan^{-1}\\left(\\frac28\\right)=-14.0^\\circ\" data-display=\"false\"></span> (3 SF)</p>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"346^\\circ\" data-display=\"false\"></span> (3 SF)</p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">c)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"3\\mathbf i+\\mathbf j-5\\mathbf i+8\\mathbf j=-2\\mathbf i+9\\mathbf j\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/smq-1.68/solutions/assets/diagrams/s1c.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>","<p>Resultant force: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\sqrt{2^2+9^2}=\\sqrt{85}=9.22\" data-display=\"false\"></span> N (3 SF)</p>","<p>Angle with <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"Ox\" data-display=\"false\"></span>: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\theta=180^\\circ-\\tan^{-1}\\left(\\frac92\\right)=103^\\circ\" data-display=\"false\"></span> (3 SF)</p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">d)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\binom{-5}{-9}+\\binom48=\\binom{-1}{-1}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/smq-1.68/solutions/assets/diagrams/s1d.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>","<p>Resultant force: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\sqrt{1^2+1^2}=\\sqrt2=1.41\" data-display=\"false\"></span> N (3 SF)</p>","<p>Angle with <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"Ox\" data-display=\"false\"></span>: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\theta=-\\left[180^\\circ-\\tan^{-1}\\left(\\frac11\\right)\\right]\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"=-135^\\circ\" data-display=\"false\"></span> (3 SF)</p>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"225^\\circ\" data-display=\"false\"></span> (3 SF)</p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">e)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"-0.5\\mathbf i+2\\mathbf j+3\\mathbf i-18\\mathbf j=2.5\\mathbf i-16\\mathbf j\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/smq-1.68/solutions/assets/diagrams/s1e.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>","<p>Resultant force: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\sqrt{2.5^2+16^2}=16.2\" data-display=\"false\"></span> N (3 SF)</p>","<p>Angle with <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"Ox\" data-display=\"false\"></span>: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\theta=-\\tan^{-1}\\left(\\frac{16}{2.5}\\right)=-81.1^\\circ\" data-display=\"false\"></span> (3 SF)</p>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"279^\\circ\" data-display=\"false\"></span> (3 SF)</p>"]},{"id":"smq-year1-1.68-q2","number":2,"question":"<p>Two forces <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf P\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf Q\" data-display=\"false\"></span> act on a particle. The vectors <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf i\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf j\" data-display=\"false\"></span> are unit vectors due east and north respectively. Find the magnitude and the bearing of the resultant force in each case:</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf P=(5\\mathbf i+3\\mathbf j)\\text{ N}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf Q=(-\\mathbf j)\\text{ N}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf P=\\binom{-5}2\\text{ N}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf Q=\\binom01\\text{ N}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf P=(2\\mathbf i-\\mathbf j)\\text{ N}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf Q=(3\\mathbf i-11\\mathbf j)\\text{ N}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf P=\\binom5{-1.2}\\text{ N}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf Q=\\binom{-6}1\\text{ N}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf P=(1.25\\mathbf i-0.75\\mathbf j)\\text{ N}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf Q=(-2.25\\mathbf i-1.75\\mathbf j)\\text{ N}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"5\\mathbf i+3\\mathbf j-\\mathbf j=5\\mathbf i+2\\mathbf j\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/smq-1.68/solutions/assets/diagrams/s2a.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>","<p>Resultant force: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\sqrt{5^2+2^2}=\\sqrt{29}=5.39\" data-display=\"false\"></span> N (3 SF)</p>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\theta=\\tan^{-1}\\left(\\frac25\\right)=21.8014\\ldots^\\circ\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p>Bearing: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"068^\\circ\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\binom{-5}2+\\binom01=\\binom{-5}3\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/smq-1.68/solutions/assets/diagrams/s2b.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>","<p>Resultant force: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\sqrt{5^2+3^2}=\\sqrt{34}=5.83\" data-display=\"false\"></span> N (3 SF)</p>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\theta=\\tan^{-1}\\left(\\frac35\\right)=30.96375653\\ldots^\\circ\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p>Bearing: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"301^\\circ\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">c)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"2\\mathbf i-\\mathbf j+3\\mathbf i-11\\mathbf j=5\\mathbf i-12\\mathbf j\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/smq-1.68/solutions/assets/diagrams/s2c.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>","<p>Resultant force: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\sqrt{5^2+12^2}=13\" data-display=\"false\"></span> N</p>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\theta=\\tan^{-1}\\left(\\frac{12}5\\right)=67.380\\ldots^\\circ\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p>Bearing: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"157^\\circ\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">d)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\binom5{-1.2}+\\binom{-6}1=\\binom{-1}{-0.2}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/smq-1.68/solutions/assets/diagrams/s2d.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>","<p>Resultant force: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\sqrt{1^2+0.2^2}=1.02\" data-display=\"false\"></span> (3 SF)</p>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\theta=\\tan^{-1}\\left(\\frac{0.2}1\\right)=11.30993\\ldots^\\circ\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p>Bearing: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"259^\\circ\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">e)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"1.25\\mathbf i-0.75\\mathbf j-2.25\\mathbf i-1.75\\mathbf j=-\\mathbf i-2.5\\mathbf j\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/smq-1.68/solutions/assets/diagrams/s2e.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>","<p>Resultant force: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\sqrt{1^2+2.5^2}=2.69\" data-display=\"false\"></span> N (3 SF)</p>","<p>Angle with <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"Ox\" data-display=\"false\"></span>: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\theta=\\tan^{-1}\\left(\\frac{2.5}1\\right)=68.19859\\ldots^\\circ\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p>Bearing: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"248^\\circ\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>"]},{"id":"smq-year1-1.68-q3","number":3,"question":"<p>The force <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\binom k5\\text{ N}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> where <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k\" data-display=\"false\"></span> is a positive constant, has a magnitude of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\sqrt{29}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> N. Find the value of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","steps":["<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\sqrt{k^2+25}=\\sqrt{29}\\Rightarrow k=2\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>"]},{"id":"smq-year1-1.68-q4","number":4,"question":"<p>The force <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(2k\\mathbf i-2k\\mathbf j)\\text{ N}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> where <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k\" data-display=\"false\"></span> is a constant, has a magnitude of 12 N and a bearing of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"315^\\circ\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Find the value of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","steps":["<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\sqrt{4k^2+4k^2}=\\sqrt{8k^2}=2\\sqrt2 k=12\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow k=\\pm3\\sqrt2\" data-display=\"false\"></span> So <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k=-3\\sqrt2\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>"]},{"id":"smq-year1-1.68-q5","number":5,"question":"<p>Two forces <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf P\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf Q\" data-display=\"false\"></span> act on a particle. The vectors <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf i\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf j\" data-display=\"false\"></span> are unit vectors due east and north respectively. Find a third force <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf R\" data-display=\"false\"></span> such that the three forces are in equilibrium:</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf P=(-2\\mathbf i+\\mathbf j)\\text{ N}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf Q=(-3\\mathbf i+11\\mathbf j)\\text{ N}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf P=\\binom{-1}0\\text{ N}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf Q=\\binom{-4}{\\sqrt3}\\text{ N}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf P=(\\sqrt2\\mathbf i-\\mathbf j)\\text{ N}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf Q=(-3\\mathbf j)\\text{ N}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf P=\\binom k1\\text{ N}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf Q=\\binom{-k}1\\text{ N}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> where <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k\" data-display=\"false\"></span> is a constant.</p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf P=(a\\mathbf i+b\\mathbf j)\\text{ N}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf Q=(-a\\mathbf i+2b\\mathbf j)\\text{ N}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> where <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"b\" data-display=\"false\"></span> are constants.</p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf P=\\binom{2a}{6a}\\text{ N}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf Q=\\binom b{6b}\\text{ N}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> where <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"b\" data-display=\"false\"></span> are constants.</p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf P+\\mathbf Q=-2\\mathbf i+\\mathbf j-3\\mathbf i+11\\mathbf j=-5\\mathbf i+12\\mathbf j\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p>Force required for equilibrium: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"5\\mathbf i-12\\mathbf j\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf P+\\mathbf Q=\\binom{-1}0+\\binom{-4}{\\sqrt3}=\\binom{-5}{\\sqrt3}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p>Force required for equilibrium: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\binom5{-\\sqrt3}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">c)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf P+\\mathbf Q=\\sqrt2\\mathbf i-\\mathbf j-3\\mathbf j=\\sqrt2\\mathbf i-4\\mathbf j\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p>Force required for equilibrium: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"-\\sqrt2\\mathbf i+4\\mathbf j\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">d)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf P+\\mathbf Q=\\binom k1+\\binom{-k}1=\\binom02\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p>Force required for equilibrium: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\binom0{-2}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">e)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf P+\\mathbf Q=a\\mathbf i+b\\mathbf j-a\\mathbf i+2b\\mathbf j=3b\\mathbf j\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p>Force required for equilibrium: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"-3b\\mathbf j\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">f)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf P+\\mathbf Q=\\binom{2a}{6a}+\\binom b{6b}=\\binom{2a+b}{6a+6b}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p>Force required for equilibrium: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\binom{-2a-b}{-6a-6b}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>"]},{"id":"smq-year1-1.68-q6","number":6,"question":"<p>The forces <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\binom a3\\text{ N}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\binom{2b}{-a}\\text{ N}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\binom{-6b}b\\text{ N}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> act on an object which is in equilibrium. Find the values of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"b\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","steps":["<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a+2b-6b=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"3-a+b=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a=4\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"b=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>"]},{"id":"smq-year1-1.68-q7","number":7,"question":"<p>Three forces, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(6\\mathbf i+10\\mathbf j)\\text{ N}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(-3.5\\mathbf i-12\\mathbf j)\\text{ N}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(-2.5\\mathbf i)\\text{ N}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> act on a particle. It begins at rest at the origin. The vectors <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf i\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf j\" data-display=\"false\"></span> are unit vectors due east and north respectively.</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p>Find the resultant force in the form <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(a\\mathbf i+b\\mathbf j)\\text{ N}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> where <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"b\" data-display=\"false\"></span> are constants to be found.</p></li><li><p>Find the magnitude and the bearing of the resultant force.</p></li><li><p>Describe the motion of the particle.</p></li><li><p>State the additional force that would be needed for the particle to instead be at rest.</p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"6\\mathbf i+10\\mathbf j-3.5\\mathbf i-12\\mathbf j-2.5\\mathbf i=-2\\mathbf j\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"b=-2\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><p>2 N at a bearing of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"180^\\circ\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">c)</h3><p>The particle is accelerating due south.</p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">d)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"2\\mathbf j\" data-display=\"false\"></span> or 2 N due North</p>"]},{"id":"smq-year1-1.68-q8","number":8,"question":"<p>Three forces, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(12\\mathbf i+11\\mathbf j)\\text{ N}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(3\\mathbf i-15\\mathbf j)\\text{ N}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(a\\mathbf i+b\\mathbf j)\\text{ N}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> act on a particle. The vectors <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf i\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf j\" data-display=\"false\"></span> are unit vectors due east and north respectively. State the values of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"b\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"b\" data-display=\"false\"></span> such that the particle is moving due East.</p>","steps":["<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"12\\mathbf i+11\\mathbf j+3\\mathbf i-15\\mathbf j+a\\mathbf i+b\\mathbf j\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"=(15+a)\\mathbf i+(-4+b)\\mathbf j\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p>Due west: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"b=4\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a&gt;-15\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>"]},{"id":"smq-year1-1.68-q9","number":9,"question":"<p>Two forces <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf P\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf Q\" data-display=\"false\"></span> act on a particle. Find the angle between the two forces:</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf P=(3\\mathbf i+4\\mathbf j)\\text{ N}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf Q=(5\\mathbf i+12\\mathbf j)\\text{ N}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf P=\\binom23\\text{ N}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf Q=\\binom51\\text{ N}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\tan^{-1}\\left(\\frac43\\right)=53.1^\\circ\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\tan^{-1}\\left(\\frac{12}5\\right)=67.4^\\circ\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p>Angle between: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"14.3^\\circ\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\tan^{-1}\\left(\\frac32\\right)-\\tan^{-1}\\left(\\frac15\\right)=45^\\circ\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>"]},{"id":"smq-year1-1.68-q10","number":10,"question":"<p>Two forces are given by <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\binom1{-7}\\text{ N}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\binom k{3k}\\text{ N}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, where <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k\" data-display=\"false\"></span> is a positive constant. Given that the resultant of these two forces is parallel to <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\binom{-4}7\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, find the value of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","steps":["<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\binom1{-7}+\\binom k{3k}=\\binom{1+k}{-7+3k}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> parallel to <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\binom{-4}7\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\binom{1+k}{-7+3k}=p\\binom{-4}7\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"1+k=-4p\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"-7+3k=7p\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p>Solving simultaneously gives <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k=\\frac{21}{19}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>"]},{"id":"smq-year1-1.68-q11","number":11,"question":"<p>Three forces, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\binom12\\text{ N}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\binom{-3}8\\text{ N}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\binom ab\\text{ N}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> act on a particle. The vectors <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf i\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf j\" data-display=\"false\"></span> are unit vectors due east and north respectively.</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p>State the values of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"b\" data-display=\"false\"></span> such that the particle is moving due North.</p></li></ol><p>It is given that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a=8\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"2\"><li><p>Find the value of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"b\" data-display=\"false\"></span> such that the particle is moving due North-East.</p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><p>Not moving east/west: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"1-3+a=0\\Rightarrow a=2\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p>Moving north: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"2+8+b&gt;0\\Rightarrow b&gt;-10\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><p>Moving east: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"1-3+8=6\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p>Moving North: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"2+8+b=6\\Rightarrow b=-4\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>"]},{"id":"smq-year1-1.68-q12","number":12,"question":"<p>Find the unit vector of each of the following vectors:</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\binom34\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"3\\mathbf i-\\mathbf j\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\binom{-1}4\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"-8\\mathbf i-6\\mathbf j\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\sqrt{3^2+4^2}=5\" data-display=\"false\"></span> so <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\frac15\\binom34\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\sqrt{3^2+1^2}=\\sqrt{10}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> so <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\frac1{\\sqrt{10}}(3\\mathbf i-\\mathbf j)\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">c)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\sqrt{1^2+4^2}=\\sqrt{17}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> so <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\frac1{\\sqrt{17}}\\binom{-1}4\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">d)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\sqrt{8^2+6^2}=10\" data-display=\"false\"></span> so <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\frac1{10}(-8\\mathbf i-6\\mathbf j)\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>"]},{"id":"smq-year1-1.68-q13","number":13,"question":"<p>The force <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf F\" data-display=\"false\"></span> is parallel to <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\overrightarrow{AB}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Given the coordinates of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and the magnitude of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf F\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, find <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf F\" data-display=\"false\"></span> in each case:</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A(0,0),\\ B(-3,-3),\\ |\\mathbf F|=5\\text{ N}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A(0,-2),\\ B(3,0),\\ |\\mathbf F|=4\\text{ N}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A(1,2),\\ B(5,6),\\ |\\mathbf F|=8\\text{ N}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\sqrt{3^2+3^2}=3\\sqrt2\" data-display=\"false\"></span> so <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf F=\\frac1{3\\sqrt2}\\binom{-3}{-3}\\times5=\\frac5{\\sqrt2}\\binom{-1}{-1}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\binom30-\\binom0{-2}=\\binom32\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\sqrt{3^2+2^2}=\\sqrt{13}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> so <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf F=\\frac1{\\sqrt{13}}\\binom32\\times4=\\frac4{\\sqrt{13}}\\binom32\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">c)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\binom56-\\binom12=\\binom44\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\sqrt{4^2+4^2}=4\\sqrt2\" data-display=\"false\"></span> so <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf F=\\frac1{4\\sqrt2}\\binom44\\times8=\\frac1{\\sqrt2}\\binom88\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>"]},{"id":"smq-year1-1.68-q14","number":14,"question":"<p><strong>Prerequisite knowledge for Q14-Q23: Constant Acceleration</strong> A resultant force of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(3\\mathbf i+4\\mathbf j)\\text{ N}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> is pushing against a particle of mass 0.5 kg. The particle is initially at rest.</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p>Find the magnitude of the acceleration of the mass</p></li><li><p>Hence find the time it takes for the particle to move 80 metres.</p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\sqrt{3^2+4^2}=\\sqrt{25}=5\" data-display=\"false\"></span> N</p>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"F=ma\\Rightarrow5=0.5a\\Rightarrow a=10\\text{ ms}^{-2}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"80=0+\\frac12\\times10\\times t^2\\Rightarrow t=4\" data-display=\"false\"></span> seconds</p>"]},{"id":"smq-year1-1.68-q15","number":15,"question":"<p>A resultant force of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\binom12\\text{ N}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> is pushing against a particle of mass 2 kg. The particle is initially at rest.</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p>Find the magnitude of the acceleration of the mass.</p></li><li><p>Hence find its speed of motion after 4 seconds.</p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\sqrt{1^2+2^2}=\\sqrt5\" data-display=\"false\"></span> N</p>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"F=ma\\Rightarrow\\sqrt5=2a\\Rightarrow a=\\frac{\\sqrt5}2=1.19\\text{ ms}^{-2}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"v=0+\\frac{\\sqrt5}2\\times4=2\\sqrt5=4.47\\text{ ms}^{-1}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>"]},{"id":"smq-year1-1.68-q16","number":16,"question":"<p>Two forces given by <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(5\\mathbf i+\\mathbf j)\\text{ N}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(-2\\mathbf i+3\\mathbf j)\\text{ N}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> are pushing against a particle of mass 4 kg. The particle is initially at rest.</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p>Find the magnitude of the acceleration of the mass.</p></li><li><p>Hence find the time it takes for the particle to move 10 metres.</p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\binom{-2}3+\\binom51=\\binom33\" data-display=\"false\"></span> so <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\sqrt{3^2+4^2}=5\" data-display=\"false\"></span> N</p>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"F=ma\\Rightarrow5=4a\\Rightarrow a=1.25\\text{ ms}^{-2}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"10=0+\\frac12\\times1.25\\times t^2\\Rightarrow t=4\" data-display=\"false\"></span> seconds</p>"]},{"id":"smq-year1-1.68-q17","number":17,"question":"<p>A force of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\binom5{11.6}\\text{ N}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> is pulling on an object of mass 2kg which is falling under the influence of gravity, where <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"g=9.8\\text{ ms}^{-2}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Find the magnitude of the acceleration of the object.</p>","steps":["<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\binom5{11.6}-2\\binom0{9.8}=\\binom5{-8}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> so <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\sqrt{5^2+8^2}=\\sqrt{89}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> N</p>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"F=ma\\Rightarrow\\sqrt{89}=2a\\Rightarrow a=4.72\\text{ ms}^{-2}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>"]},{"id":"smq-year1-1.68-q18","number":18,"question":"<p>An object of mass 2 kg is dropped. A force of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(4.5\\mathbf i+13.6\\mathbf j)\\text{ N}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> is pulling on the object as it falls under the influence of gravity, where <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"g=9.8\\text{ ms}^{-2}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p>Find the magnitude of the object's acceleration.</p></li><li><p>Another force of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(-4.5\\mathbf i+5.5\\mathbf j)\\text{ N}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> is applied to the object. Find the magnitude of the object's acceleration now.</p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf F=\\binom{4.5}{13.6}-2\\binom0{9.8}=\\binom{4.5}{-6}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf F=m\\mathbf a\\Rightarrow\\binom{4.5}{-6}=2\\mathbf a\\Rightarrow\\mathbf a=\\binom{2.25}{-3}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"|\\mathbf a|=\\sqrt{2.25^2+(-3)^2}=3.75\\text{ ms}^{-2}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf F=\\binom{4.5}{13.6}-2\\binom0{9.8}+\\binom{-4.5}{5.5}=\\binom0{-\\frac12}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf F=m\\mathbf a\\Rightarrow\\binom0{-\\frac12}=2\\mathbf a\\Rightarrow\\mathbf a=\\binom0{-\\frac14}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"|\\mathbf a|=\\sqrt{0^2+\\left(-\\frac14\\right)^2}=0.25\\text{ ms}^{-2}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>"]},{"id":"smq-year1-1.68-q19","number":19,"question":"<p>A resultant force <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf F\" data-display=\"false\"></span> N parallel to <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"4\\mathbf i-3\\mathbf j\" data-display=\"false\"></span> is pulling a box of mass 4 kg. The particle is initially at rest. It takes 2 seconds to travel 5 metres. Find the vector form of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf F\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","steps":["<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"5=0+\\frac12a\\times4\\Rightarrow a=2.5\\text{ ms}^{-2}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\sqrt{4^2+3^2}=5\" data-display=\"false\"></span> so <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\frac15\\binom4{-3}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf F=m\\mathbf a\\Rightarrow\\mathbf F=4\\times2.5=10\" data-display=\"false\"></span> N</p>","<p>So <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf F=\\frac15\\binom4{-3}\\times10=\\binom8{-6}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>"]},{"id":"smq-year1-1.68-q20","number":20,"question":"<p>A resultant force <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf F\" data-display=\"false\"></span> N parallel to <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"8\\mathbf i+4\\mathbf j\" data-display=\"false\"></span> is pulling a box of mass 3 kg. Initially it is moving at <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"1\\text{ ms}^{-1}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> but reaches <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"4\\text{ ms}^{-1}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> in 5 seconds. Find the vector form of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf F\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","steps":["<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"4=1+a\\times5\\Rightarrow a=0.6\\text{ ms}^{-2}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\sqrt{8^2+4^2}=4\\sqrt5\" data-display=\"false\"></span> so <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\frac1{4\\sqrt5}\\binom84=\\frac1{\\sqrt5}\\binom21\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf F=m\\mathbf a\\Rightarrow\\mathbf F=3\\times0.6=1.8\" data-display=\"false\"></span> N</p>","<p>So <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf F=\\frac1{\\sqrt5}\\binom21\\times1.8=\\frac{9\\sqrt5}{25}\\binom21\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>"]},{"id":"smq-year1-1.68-q21","number":21,"question":"<p>Two vectors <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\binom3{-2}\\text{ N}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\binom pq\\text{ N}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> are acting on a box of mass 5 kg which is initially at rest. The box moves in the direction <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\binom21\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p>Show that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"p-2q+7=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li></ol><p>Given that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"p=5\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"2\"><li><p>Find the distance the box has travelled in 5 seconds.</p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\binom pq+\\binom3{-2}=\\binom{p+3}{q-2}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> parallel to <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\binom21\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"1(p+3)=2(q-2)\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"p+3=2q-4\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"p-2q+7=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span> as req.</p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"p=5\\Rightarrow q=6\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\binom{5+3}{6-2}=\\binom84\\Rightarrow F=\\sqrt{8^2+4^2}=4\\sqrt5\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"F=ma\\Rightarrow4\\sqrt5=5\\times a\\Rightarrow a=\\frac45\\sqrt5\\text{ ms}^{-2}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"s=0+\\frac12\\times\\frac45\\sqrt5\\times5^2\\Rightarrow s=10\\sqrt5=22.4\" data-display=\"false\"></span> m</p>"]},{"id":"smq-year1-1.68-q22","number":22,"question":"<p>Two vectors <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"3\\mathbf i-\\mathbf j\" data-display=\"false\"></span> N and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"p\\mathbf i+q\\mathbf j\" data-display=\"false\"></span> N are acting on a box of mass 3 kg which is initially at rest. The box moves in the direction <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf i+5\\mathbf j\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p>Show that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"5p-q+16=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li></ol><p>Given that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"q=6\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"2\"><li><p>Find the speed of the box after 3 seconds.</p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(p+3)\\mathbf i+(q-1)\\mathbf j\" data-display=\"false\"></span> is parallel to <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf i+5\\mathbf j\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"5(p+3)=1(q-1)\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"5p+15=q-1\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"5p-q+16=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span> as req.</p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"q=6\\Rightarrow p=-2\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf i+5\\mathbf j\\Rightarrow F=\\sqrt{1^2+5^2}=\\sqrt{26}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"F=ma\\Rightarrow\\sqrt{26}=3\\times a\\Rightarrow a=\\frac13\\sqrt{26}\\text{ ms}^{-2}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"v=0+\\frac13\\sqrt{26}\\times3\\Rightarrow v=\\sqrt{26}=5.10\\text{ ms}^{-1}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>"]},{"id":"smq-year1-1.68-q23","number":23,"question":"<p>Two vectors <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\binom{-1}4\\text{ N}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\binom pq\\text{ N}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> are acting on a box of mass 2 kg which is initially at rest. The box moves in the direction <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\binom34\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p>Show that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"4p-3q-16=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li></ol><p>It begins at position <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A\" data-display=\"false\"></span> with a speed of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"2\\text{ ms}^{-1}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Given that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"p=-2\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"2\"><li><p>Find the speed of the box after 3 seconds.</p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\binom pq+\\binom{-1}4=\\binom{p-1}{q+4}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> parallel to <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\binom34\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"4(p-1)=3(q+4)\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"4p-4=3q+12\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"4p-3q-16=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span> as req.</p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"p=-2\\Rightarrow q=-8\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\binom{-2-1}{-8+4}=\\binom{-3}{-4}\\Rightarrow F=\\sqrt{3^2+4^2}=5\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"F=ma\\Rightarrow5=2\\times a\\Rightarrow a=\\frac52\\text{ ms}^{-2}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p><span class=\"inline